      "instance_name": "parental_divorce",
      "label": "Parental Divorce",
      "description": "The concept of parental divorce is a real-world social and legal event that involves the legal dissolution of a marriage between two parents, often resulting in significant emotional, psychological, and financial impacts on children. The meme references this event as a catalyst for increased birthday presents, implying a cynical or humorous perspective on family dynamics and child welfare.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
