      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "child_birthday_presents",
      "label": "Child Birthday Presents",
      "description": "The cultural norm of giving birthday presents to children is a widely recognized social ritual, often tied to celebrations of age and milestones. The meme uses this concept to imply a perceived benefit from parental divorce, which is not a real-world norm but a satirical exaggeration.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
