      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "cynical_parental_divorce_meme",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who engage with internet humor that trivializes or cynically exaggerates the consequences of parental divorce, particularly those who find amusement in the idea that children benefit materially from family breakdown. This includes users of meme culture who appreciate dark humor, satire, or ironic takes on serious social issues, often within online forums or social media platforms where such content is shared and commented on. The meme’s visual trope of the smug child reinforces its appeal to audiences familiar with internet meme aesthetics and tropes.",
